{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車のドア付近で\n倫理の教科書持ちながら\n立ったまま寝てる人いたら\n中田に見てください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初夏の候、湿気故に髪の状態があまり優れませんが近頃終わると信じてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は夏至の日だよね！\n日が長いんだっけ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近レッスン前に\n簡単な準備体操しかしなかったせいで\n体が前より固くなっちゃった(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"並みより柔らかいのが\n唯一の中田の特技(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐ戻すからね｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"軟体動物うぃるそん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/21/5927153/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はどこに行ってきたの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nレッスンとかだよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて握手したアイドルは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nAKB48の篠田さんです＼^^／\nなつかしいなあ(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヲタ時代アイドルと街で\nばったり会ったことある？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nSDN48の浦野さんに会ったことある！\nあと、AKB48の永尾さん、島崎さん、島田さん、阿部さんが一緒にいたのにもあった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台風の日は何してた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nおとといはレッスンしてたよ(¨)ノ\nみんな大丈夫だった？＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の記事の絵の答え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上：ゆったん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下：さゆりんご"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両方正解した人いなかった(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外にみんなの絵がどんな感じかとか\nわからないもんなんだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/21/5927153/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなに絵見る機会無いしね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも問題出してこ(・∀・)\n難易度さげます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/21/5927153/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くだらなくてもつきあってね？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/21/5927153/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごはこの髪型が好き(*^^*)\nツインツイン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/21/5927153/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}